{"description":"Message of a Timeline Entry on a evidence timeline that carries one whole proof. Acceptance is decided only by the proof's public output; document and operationEntry are a routing hint. The schema is open: the processor checks that receipt, document and operationEntry are the only fields and are well formed, and skips an entry that is not.","document":{"description":"Reference by content BlueId, {blueId: ...}, to the document by its initial BlueId, the same for every participant; the convention an Operation Request uses for its document. A free field: presence and form are checked by the processor, not by this schema."},"name":"Proof Entry","operationEntry":{"description":"Reference by content BlueId, {blueId: ...}, to the operation's Timeline Entry. A free field: presence and form are checked by the processor, not by this schema."},"receipt":{"description":"Complete proof in the single encoding admitted by the channel's evidence profile, as canonical base64 text: RFC 4648 standard alphabet with padding, zero pad bits and no other characters. Presence, text form and encoding are checked by the processor, not by this schema."},"specification":{"blueId":"DKSQLfTLQncVfoJL85NQHoShR36YD5U5t8zdqPgUdEcr"}}
